# Local, uncommitted agent files a *user* of this repo generates.
# This repo ships templates and blueprints, not personal state: a reader's
# own personal settings overlay, their own adoption-loop run workspace, and
# their own collected profile facts are theirs, are often per-machine, and
# were never meant to be committed back into this repository.
.claude/settings.local.json
adoption/**/runs/
profiles/**/collected/
profiles/**/local/
